Good. Now I have enough to implement.

Model names: I'll default vision model to `hunyuan-vision` (per docs "hunyuan-vision 和 hunyuan-turbo-vision 支持"). Text model default `hunyuan-turbos-latest` (example in docs). Env configurable.

Now implement:

### recognize/providers/hunyuan.js

```js
const tencentcloud = require('tencentcloud-sdk-nodejs-hunyuan');

const HunyuanClient = tencentcloud.hunyuan.v20230901.Client;

let client = null;

function getClient() {
  if (client) return client;
  const secretId = process.env.TENCENTCLOUD_SECRET_ID;
  const secretKey = process.env.TENCENTCLOUD_SECRET_KEY;
  if (!secretId || !secretKey) {
    throw new Error('缺少 TENCENTCLOUD_SECRET_ID / TENCENTCLOUD_SECRET_KEY');
  }
  client = new HunyuanClient({
    credential: { secretId, secretKey },
    region: process.env.TENCENTCLOUD_REGION || 'ap-guangzhou',
    profile: {
      httpProfile: {
        endpoint: 'hunyuan.tencentcloudapi.com',
        reqTimeout: 15,
      },
    },
  });
  return client;
}
```

Wait, `reqTimeout` unit is seconds in tencentcloud SDK? httpProfile.reqTimeout default 60 (seconds). Yes, seconds.

Detect mime:
```js
